  "decisions": [
    "來源 lineage、GitHub唯讀且有界pagination、Preview/DB identity、read-only transaction、隔離restore、checksum和cleanup保留。",
    "cd357 的兩個PayUni檔相較已核對177554來源，只差舊版缺少/api的query URL及非string欄位trim；主線保留已驗證較完整版本，query supersession證據可據此延伸。",
    "backup source固定919332而非任意SHA，從immutable migration manifest導出79總數；來源可有少於79條已套用且無失敗/checksum差異，明確標示MIGRATIONS_PENDING而非UP_TO_DATE，backup不授權migration。",
    "新active history名稱重複與source snapshot count drift檢查保留；rollback需有同名同checksum完成counterpart，restore數量對應實際source。",
    "保留獨立staging age recipient加密artifact及固定檔案驗證；不使用Production recipient、不保存raw dump。retention recoverability為NOT_PROVEN、migrationAuthorization為BLOCKED，公鑰加密不等於恢復證明。",
    "retained recovery以固定source及獨立pinned migration tree驗證，不依未來HEAD；ancestor/squash-equivalence原路徑仍保留，wrong source/tree fail closed。",
    "workflow保留protected master、固定allowlist、secret injection前下載工具及source驗證、bounded egress、receipt驗證、失敗強制exit；新payment-only受同等約束及獨立receipt gate。",
    "CI新增bounded Stream contract，其他原有checks保留；文件明列密文保存30天和需另行解密還原證明，無新增未執行PASS。"
  ],
